Z||000023||Earne||03-16-2000||05:22 PM||||Fiero Parts and Appraisals is on their second round of Borla exhaust systems.  They have already sold the first 100 sets that they went out on a limb and ordered.  I know because I bought set 93 and I'm told Tim sold the last six sets at the Columbus show after I showed my car at his display with the FieroStore Chetah pipe (cat eliminator, big hit).  In case anyone is looking at the new Borla set from Tim, take note that these sets aren't supposed to come with tips.  If that is true, it changes the price a bit.  Total:  $576.12,  including Borla tips and shipping (install?)||||reg||1
